        "title": "Studio costs add up. The FLEX PRO pays for itself.",
        "text": "At $1,800 AUD, the FLEX PRO costs less than seven months of twice-weekly studio sessions at $45 per class. After that break-even point, every session is essentially free. Over three years, the savings amount to approximately $8,500–$13,400 compared to studio sessions — and that's before accounting for the additional strength training value that eliminates the need for a separate gym membership."
      }
